,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107619","id":2982368932,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xw1ak","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T02:07:13Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T02:07:13Z","body":"Ok, so there is a bit more to this than we initially thought. See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107612#issuecomment-2982366758\r\n\r\nI think there are a few good changes in this that we should keep, but the original fix is unnecesairy. I'll commit an update shortly. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2982368932/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2983043412","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107619#issuecomment-2983043412","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107619","id":2983043412,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xzaFU","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T07:38:44Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T07:38:44Z","body":"Changed this over as discussed in the issue after a long discussion in the OpenXR WG. Our original conclusions weren't correct but did find a few tweaks we should do.\r\n\r\nIn the end this mostly introduces the ability to obtain the session state, which is useful. Right now in many projects I'm tracking the state by reacting on the signals and I gather many others do too. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2983043412/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2983490960","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107619#issuecomment-2983490960","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107619","id":2983490960,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6x1HWQ","user":{"login":"Kimau","id":905911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTkxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/905911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau","html_url":"https://github.com/Kimau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T09:46:27Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T09:46:27Z","body":"On surface looks great but you need to check this with some different runtimes, might have improved but espcially with PCVR and different streaming runtimes we had a nightmare time with the engine I maintained at Adobe. Partly it was because the application was a hybrid app between desktop and VR so users don/doffed the headset more than is typical but these state transitations can get horribly locked if your not careful.\r\n\r\nAlso be aware the spec doesn't guarantee you transition through all states. So you can jump from Sync -> Focused skipping visible for example. Also the shutdowns often aren't clean.\r\n\r\nI'm not updating the engine for the current title I'm working on and I doubt this would affect it but for hybrid XR apps this stuff is critical and a minefield.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2983490960/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2983607480","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107619#issuecomment-2983607480","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107619","id":2983607480,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6x1jy4","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T10:17:08Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T10:17:08Z","body":"@Kimau indeed, in hindsight we undid the main timing change because after discussing at length, it seemed incorrect and the behaviour issue is likely an XR runtime issue that we can work around in the extension itself until it's fixed. So I don't think anything is left in this that will change the flow.\r\n\r\nWith adding the extra signal and documentation around the different states, hopefully it clears up what the expected behaviour is. So far I think we've got things working in a way that runtimes that skip the synchronisation and/or visible states and go straight to focussed will work just fine.\r\n\r\nThe main issue, as was mentioned in the issue and has been reported a number of times over time, is one that is actually intentional. E.g, if we're in the visible state (either headset off, user has entered a system menu, or task switched to a different application), we no longer receive XR input and positional updates of controllers.\r\n\r\nThis has been an oft cause of frustration with users as OpenVR doesn't have(/had) this behaviour but it is one enforced by OpenXR and for good reasons as getting input in these situations can adversely effect the user experience at best, and potentially create an avenue for social hacking at worst..","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2983607480/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2986025105","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107619#issuecomment-2986025105","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107619","id":2986025105,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6x-yCR","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-18T23:30:58Z","updated_at":"2025-06-18T23:30:58Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2986025105/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]